      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_motor_attributes.dita" xtrc="p:2;26:10">The figures display the image and name of the motor attribute, the motor attribute’s health index value, the health, and the action required.</p>
